{"translation":{"id":"kan_okcv","name":"Biblica® ಉಚಿತ ಕನ್ನಡ ಸಮಕಾಲಿಕ ಭಾಷಾಂತರ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=kanokcv","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=kanokcv","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"OKCV","englishName":"Kanada Open Contemporary Version Bible","language":"kan","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"579eda1a2f0787e978bfdd1e238e1f22be5be659c98add6930ad2d796778f705","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/kan_okcv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31090,"languageName":"ಕನ್ನಡ","languageEnglishName":"Kannada"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"kan_okcv","name":"ಕೀರ್ತನೆಗಳು","commonName":"ಕೀರ್ತನೆಗಳು","title":"ಕೀರ್ತನೆಗಳು","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"8fda6557d2590d4e512d2801111ece4ef0438ce426c3b9b41fc862a02e5e2271","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/kan_okcv/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/kan_okcv/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2461},"chapter":{"number":100,"content":[{"type":"hebrew_subtitle","content":["ಕೀರ್ತನೆ. ಕೃತಜ್ಞತೆಯ ಗೀತೆ."]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"ಸಮಸ್ತ ಭೂಮಿಯೇ, ಯೆಹೋವ ದೇವರಿಗೆ ಜಯಧ್ವನಿ ಮಾಡಿರಿ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"ಸಂತೋಷದಿಂದ ಯೆಹೋವ ದೇವರನ್ನು ಆರಾಧಿಸಿರಿ;","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಆನಂದದಿಂದ ಹಾಡುತ್ತಾ ಅವರ ಮುಂದೆ ಬನ್ನಿರಿ.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"text":"ಯೆಹೋವ ದೇವರೇ ದೇವರೆಂದು ತಿಳುಕೊಳ್ಳಿರಿ;","poem":1},{"text":"ಅವರೇ ನಮ್ಮನ್ನು ಉಂಟುಮಾಡಿದ್ದಾರೆ;","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ನಾವು ಅವರ ಜನರೂ, ಅವರು ಮೇಯಿಸುವ ಕುರಿ ಮಂದೆಯೂ ಆಗಿದ್ದೇವೆ.","poem":2}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"ಕೃತಜ್ಞತೆಯಿಂದ ಅವರ ಬಾಗಿಲುಗಳಿಗೂ,","poem":1},{"text":"ಕೃತಜ್ಞತಾ ಸ್ತೋತ್ರದಿಂದ ಅವರ ಅಂಗಳಗಳಿಗೂ ಬನ್ನಿರಿ;","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಅವರನ್ನು ಕೊಂಡಾಡಿರಿ, ಅವರ ಹೆಸರನ್ನು ಸ್ತುತಿಸಿರಿ.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"ಯೆಹೋವ ದೇವರು ಒಳ್ಳೆಯವರು, ಅವರ ಕರುಣೆಯು ಯುಗಯುಗಕ್ಕೂ ಇರುವುದು.","poem":1},{"text":"ಅವರ ಸತ್ಯತೆಯು ತಲತಲಾಂತರಕ್ಕೂ ಮುಂದುವರಿಯುವುದು.","poem":2}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/kan_okcv/PSA/100.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/kan_okcv/PSA/101.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/kan_okcv/PSA/99.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":5}